-## 6. Puesta en marcha
-
-```bash
-npm install
-cp .env.example .env          # completar DB_*, JWT_SECRET (>=32), Drive, WhatsApp, PORTAL_BASE_URL
-npm run migrate               # aplica database/migrations/*.sql
-ADMIN_EMAIL=… ADMIN_PASSWORD=… npm run crear-admin   # contraseña >= 12 caracteres
-npm test && npm start
-```
